    {
      "id": "u_d17e5c2fe6c97951fba116d1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In Trilium, to-do items aren't limited to a simple \"done\" or \"not done.\" Tasks can also be marked as __TRILIUM_PH_0__in progress__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (\"doing\"), __TRILIUM_PH_2__under consideration__TRILIUM_PH_3__ (\"maybe\"), or __TRILIUM_PH_4__cancelled__TRILIUM_PH_5__ (\"won't do\"), thus giving a more accurate picture of where things actually stand.",
      "sourceHash": "d17e5c2fe6c97951fba116d1735a420b0920f5088149118f8bf2f00923016b42",
      "context": "To-do Lists > Extended task states",
      "contextHash": "bc1ef0d8e73b84315626efd557d4319ce10e6480d99153a38e4c44df95e8d3cc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f8617cdbe32967c713424840_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Right-click the checkbox and select the desired state. Alternatively, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__Enter __TRILIUM_PH_5__ to cycle through the task states. Tapping or left-clicking the checkbox, or pressing __TRILIUM_PH_6__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_7__+__TRILIUM_PH_8__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_9__ in the item, will always toggle between \"None\" and \"Done\". On the __TRILIUM_PH_10__Mobile Frontend__TRILIUM_PH_11__, the states are buttons in the row of the __TRILIUM_PH_12__List ›__TRILIUM_PH_13__ button, which shows while the cursor is in the list.",
      "sourceHash": "f8617cdbe32967c713424840ea984fb122759de6a199af0fcd6ee80a6f555f9b",
      "context": "To-do Lists > Extended task states",
      "contextHash": "bc1ef0d8e73b84315626efd557d4319ce10e6480d99153a38e4c44df95e8d3cc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_930a28a4744c802fba84a037_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Task states are fully preserved when converting between __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_3__ notes, in both directions.",
      "sourceHash": "930a28a4744c802fba84a037ce0b9faa1e05430e1a4b052bdfae55e802d52ee8",
      "context": "To-do Lists > Extended task states",
      "contextHash": "bc1ef0d8e73b84315626efd557d4319ce10e6480d99153a38e4c44df95e8d3cc",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_03e115fb03228058a10ebb3a_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Customizing the extended task states__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "03e115fb03228058a10ebb3a6a0b0d5fb5c54367826c3d4c6f35f42432219593",
      "context": "To-do Lists > Extended task states > Customizing the extended task states",
      "contextHash": "5a3108fcd786d773c53b5c59a472f7b77c0adcfc64294a562a60adf21e44db1f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d212ae01511a6ec43a4483d7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Task states are customizable: you can reorder them, create new ones with different colors and symbols, or delete the ones you don't need. See __TRILIUM_PH_0__Customizing to-do task states__TRILIUM_PH_1__ for more details.",
      "sourceHash": "d212ae01511a6ec43a4483d78fb2df0a91fc58c5fb0064629a174f49a79998e1",
      "context": "To-do Lists > Extended task states > Customizing the extended task states",
