    {
      "id": "u_cace6248ec1b39f592a08577_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Extended task states are supported as well, using its corresponding __TRILIUM_PH_0__Markdown symbol__TRILIUM_PH_1__. These are the defaults but they can be changed if needed (see __TRILIUM_PH_2__Customizing to-do task states__TRILIUM_PH_3__):",
