      "source": "To reorder the item under the cursor, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Up__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_5__+__TRILIUM_PH_6__Down__TRILIUM_PH_7__. To reorder multiple items, select them first.",
      "sourceHash": "f0640d90e9ec3c970e09c2a816fa15464a0e551d1452abdd632476a25ac80caa",
      "context": "To-do Lists > Keyboard shortcuts",
